  "problem": "What is ${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /6}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x$ expressed as the limit of a right Riemann sum?\n\n*Hint: Write down the missing expression in terms of $i$ and $n.$*\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /6}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}$\n{{field-1}}\n$\\cdot \\,\\frac{\\pi }{6n}$",
